  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fb1c09320a8bde07ef1d0e27b46ce5fb9ad317d3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fb1c09320a8bde07ef1d0e27b46ce5fb9ad317d3\" data-origin-width=\"614\" data-origin-height=\"605\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">전국에&#160;계신<span style=\"color: #ef6f53;\">&#160;1만&#160;재과만&#160;슨생님들</span>&#129392; </span></b><br><br><b>방방곳곳&#160;계신&#160;현지인&#160;<br>&#55357;&#56902;&#8205;&#9792;과학쌤&#55357;&#56902;&#8205;&#9794;들의 </b><br><b>맛집을&#160;모아보려합니다! </b><br><br><b>맛집&#160;정보는&#160;넘쳐나지만 </b><br><b>찐!!! 과학쌤의&#160;추천이라면 </b><br><b>또&#160;얘기가&#160;달라집니다! </b><br><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#127759;패들렛&#127759;에&#160;간단히 </span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">지역&#160;/&#160;가게명&#160;/&#160;특징 </span></b><br><b>올려주시면</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b> </b><br><a href=\"https://padlet.com/stringweek/food\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://padlet.com/stringweek/food</a><br><br><b>자료를&#160;모두&#160;모아&#160; </b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">&#128664;네이버지도&#160;링크&#128664;로&#160;<br>네비에&#160;바로&#160;연동되는&#160;(저장)을&#160;<br>제공</span>하겠습니다.&#160; </b><br><br><b>마음&#160;속&#160;깊숙히&#160;담아놓으신&#160; </b><br><b>찐 맛집을 올려주세요&#9829; </b><br><br><b>나도나도&#160;인정!&#160;하는&#160;맛집은<span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #8a3db6;\">패들렛에&#160;&#128077;좋아요&#160;&#128196;댓글도&#160;좋아요!</span></span></b><br>&#160;</p><hr data-ke-style=\"style5\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>현재까지 [저장] 한 [네이버 지도</b>] <br>맛집지도 링크입니다.<br><br><a href=\"http://naver.me/xDKRuuOj\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">http://naver.me/xDKRuuOj</a></span></b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditab